5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I’m really excited to help pick the best expansion. I just worry about plans falling apart when things get unpredictable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Yumi, your caution is noted. I worry we’re ignoring past data. Let’s not reinvent the wheel based on vibes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I observe your reliance on sentiment. Data is objective. I will verify the actual skill sets on our roster before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Benjamin. We must examine the structural funding first. I will review the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think we should check the bus links in the two outer wards first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I hear you! But I think we should check the winter road closures north of the river to see how bad it gets.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, fair point. But let’s also check the two programmes begun six years ago. We need to know if they actually stuck.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training. We must confirm who actually possesses the required competencies before assigning new duties.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will review the running and equipment lines last year. We need to see where the actual costs landed versus the projections.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. It helps me understand who is already reaching us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that sounds great! I’m also checking the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see if people actually showed up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your focus on skills is valid, but I suspect the real issue is whether we’re repeating past mistakes. I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, sentiment is not a metric. I will verify the volunteer register and supervision training to ensure our staff can actually handle the workload.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your focus is narrow. I need to see the county grant terms and the endowment to understand the long-term financial stability.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still a bit unsure, but I’ll stick with the bus links and evening bookings. It feels important to see who can actually reach us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the winter road closures and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. Let’s see what actually happened!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll review the two programmes begun six years ago and the running and equipment lines. We need to see what actually worked, not just what sounded good.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training. Competence is the only variable that matters.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I will review the county grant terms and the endowment, plus the running and equipment lines. We need to see the true financial shape.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings. I need to know who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
